    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610450/extras/22eda85e9ed952163a42d6aa244bbd2e.avif?t=1727197837\" /></div><br><br>What if time stopped and the dreams and hopes of everyone could never be fulfilled? Now, your goal will be the time.<br><br>An artistic adventure with a living narrative in which returning lost creativity to a world without identity will be your way forward. Join Ill\u00e1i and Ill\u00fa through the universe of Nubla solving the puzzles of the time-lapse and make the time go on again.<br><br>Enjoy an unforgettable trip inspired by the artistic works of Thyssen-Bornemisza Museum.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610450/extras/68487dad663243cb60bbd22e1702a8ef.poster.avif?t=1727197837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610450/extras/68487dad663243cb60bbd22e1702a8ef.webm?t=1727197837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610450/extras/68487dad663243cb60bbd22e1702a8ef.mp4?t=1727197837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610450/extras/fa8ed1c83b627fd42a49fafc644d4ec8.avif?t=1727197837\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>References to the artistic works of the most important artist in history.<br></li><li>Interactive dynamic puzzles.<br></li><li>Pure living artistic narrative.<br></li><li>Play and learn; culture and entertainment.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610450/extras/dd93af13a4ad0b2f2b8f19332df2d071.poster.avif?t=1727197837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610450/extras/dd93af13a4ad0b2f2b8f19332df2d071.webm?t=1727197837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610450/extras/dd93af13a4ad0b2f2b8f19332df2d071.mp4?t=1727197837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610450/extras/22eda85e9ed952163a42d6aa244bbd2e.avif?t=1727197837\" /></div><br><br>What if time stopped and the dreams and hopes of everyone could never be fulfilled? Now, your goal will be the time.<br><br>An artistic adventure with a living narrative in which returning lost creativity to a world without identity will be your way forward. Join Ill\u00e1i and Ill\u00fa through the universe of Nubla solving the puzzles of the time-lapse and make the time go on again.<br><br>Enjoy an unforgettable trip inspired by the artistic works of Thyssen-Bornemisza Museum.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610450/extras/68487dad663243cb60bbd22e1702a8ef.poster.avif?t=1727197837\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610450/extras/68487dad663243cb60bbd22e1702a8ef.webm?t=1727197837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610450/extras/68487dad663243cb60bbd22e1702a8ef.mp4?t=1727197837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610450/extras/fa8ed1c83b627fd42a49fafc644d4ec8.avif?t=1727197837\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>References to the artistic works of the most important artist in history.<br></li><li>Interactive dynamic puzzles.<br></li><li>Pure living artistic narrative.<br></li><li>Play and learn; culture and entertainment.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1610450/extras/dd93af13a4ad0b2f2b8f19332df2d071.poster.avif?t=1